# The help centre's build (docs/, `make html-all`), for the workflows that build
# it without the rest of the site (docs.yml, deploy-demo.yml).
#
# This is the source: edit it, then run scripts/compile_requirements.sh, which
# writes docs/requirements.txt from it with every package's hashes (pip-compile from pip-tools;
# commit both). Never edit docs/requirements.txt by hand. pip then installs only files whose
# hash matches (MAINTENANCE.md, "Hash-checked installs").
#
# Constrained to requirements-dev.txt, so the docs build with the same versions
# as in the devcontainer.
-c ../requirements-dev.txt

